# Design system and Tailwind

Authoritative references: [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md), [app/globals.css](app/globals.css), [tailwind.config.ts](tailwind.config.ts).

## Colors and surfaces

- Prefer semantic classes: `text-ink`, `text-body-color`, `text-brand-muted`, `bg-canvas`, `bg-surface-card`, `border-hairline`, and shadcn `background` / `foreground` / `muted` / `primary` where appropriate.
- Avoid `text-[#...]`, `bg-[#...]`, and one-off hex in class names unless you add a named token in the theme first.

## Typography

- Use extended scale: `text-display-*`, `text-title-md`, `text-title-sm`, `text-body-md`, `text-body-sm`, `text-caption`, `font-display`, `font-sans` instead of raw `text-[20px]` for product UI.

## Spacing, radius, shadow

- Prefer spacing tokens (`xxs`, `xs`, `sm`, `base`, `md`, `lg`, `xl`, `section`), radius tokens (`rounded-lg`, `rounded-pill`, …), and shadow tokens per DESIGN.md (`shadow-card`, `shadow-card-hover`, `shadow-float` for tight fixed overlays) — not `gap-[5px]` or ad-hoc `shadow-[...]`.

## shadcn

- Reuse [components/ui](components/ui) with variants instead of duplicating primitives.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div className="text-[#181821] gap-[5px] rounded-[10px] shadow-[0px_4px_4px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]">

// ✅ GOOD
<div className="text-ink gap-xxs rounded-lg shadow-card">
```
